<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>A letter for you ♡</title>

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f5, #fce1eb, #fff7f8);
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  color: #87566a;
}

.container {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 30px 15px;
  text-align: center;
}

h1 {
  font-size: 25px;
  font-weight: normal;
}

.subtitle {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #b68b9e;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.envelope-wrapper {
  position: relative;
  width: 300px;
  height: 205px;
  margin: auto;
  cursor: pointer;
  perspective: 1000px;
}

.envelope {
  position: absolute;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  bottom: 0;
  background: #eeb8cc;
  border-radius: 5px;
  z-index: 1;
}

.letter {
  position: absolute;
  left: 10px;
  bottom: 10px;
  width: 280px;
  height: 175px;
  padding: 20px 15px;
  background: #fffdfb;
  border-radius: 5px;
  z-index: 2;
  transition: transform 1s ease, height 1s ease;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 10px #d9a7bb55;
}

.letter-content {
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.8s ease;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.letter-content h2 {
  color: #c47796;
  font-weight: normal;
  font-size: 19px;
}

.front {
  position: absolute;
  width: 0;
  height: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 4;
}

.front-left {
  left: 0;
  border-left: 150px solid #f4ccda;
  border-top: 102px solid transparent;
  border-bottom: 103px solid transparent;
}

.front-right {
  right: 0;
  border-right: 150px solid #f1c1d3;
  border-top: 102px solid transparent;
  border-bottom: 103px solid transparent;
}

.front-bottom {
  bottom: 0;
  border-bottom: 105px solid #e8abc2;
  border-left: 150px solid transparent;
  border-right: 150px solid transparent;
  z-index: 5;
}

.flap {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  width: 0;
  height: 0;
  border-top: 120px solid #d991ae;
  border-left: 150px solid transparent;
  border-right: 150px solid transparent;
  transform-origin: top;
  transition: transform 0.8s ease;
  z-index: 6;
}

.heart {
  position: absolute;
  top: 85px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  z-index: 7;
  font-size: 32px;
  transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
}

.envelope-wrapper.open .flap {
  transform: rotateX(180deg);
  z-index: 1;
}

.envelope-wrapper.open .heart {
  opacity: 0;
}

.envelope-wrapper.open .letter {
  transform: translateY(-145px);
  height: 300px;
  z-index: 8;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.envelope-wrapper.open .letter-content {
  opacity: 1;
  transition-delay: 0.7s;
}

button {
  margin-top: 180px;
  padding: 12px 28px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: #d991ae;
  color: white;
  font-size: 14px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover {
  transform: scale(1.05);
}

.footer {
  margin-top: 30px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #bd91a5;
}

.floating-heart {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: -20px;
  color: #e9a4bf;
  pointer-events: none;
  animation: floatUp 4s linear forwards;
  z-index: 20;
}

@keyframes floatUp {
  0% {
    transform: translateY(0);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  20% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  100% {
    transform: translateY(-100vh) rotate(30deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>A little letter for you ♡</h1>
<p class="subtitle">I have something to tell you...</p>

<div class="envelope-wrapper" id="envelope"
onclick="toggleLetter()">

<div class="envelope"></div>

<div class="letter">
<div class="letter-content">

<h2>Dear you ♡</h2>

<p>Mình có một chút điều muốn nói với bạn...</p>

<p>
Cảm ơn bạn vì đã xuất hiện.
Có những điều nhỏ bé thôi nhưng lại khiến
một ngày trở nên đặc biệt hơn rất nhiều.
</p>

<p>
Mong bạn luôn vui vẻ, bình an
và có thật nhiều điều tốt đẹp trong cuộc sống nhé.
</p>

<p style="text-align:right">
From someone who cares ♡
</p>

</div>
</div>

<div class="front front-left"></div>
<div class="front front-right"></div>
<div class="front front-bottom"></div>

<div class="flap"></div>
<div class="heart">♥</div>

</div>

<button id="openButton" onclick="toggleLetter()">
Open my letter ♡
</button>

<p class="footer">made with love ♡</p>

</div>

<script>
let isOpen = false;

function toggleLetter() {
  const envelope = document.getElementById("envelope");
  const button = document.getElementById("openButton");

  isOpen = !isOpen;
  envelope.classList.toggle("open", isOpen);

  button.innerText = isOpen
    ? "Close letter ♡"
    : "Open my letter ♡";

  if (isOpen) {
    createHearts();
  }
}

function createHearts() {
  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {
    setTimeout(() => {
      const heart = document.createElement("div");
      heart.className = "floating-heart";
      heart.innerText = ["♡", "♥", "✿"][Math.floor(Math.random() * 3)];
      heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
      heart.style.fontSize = (14 + Math.random() * 18) + "px";

      document.body.appendChild(heart);

      setTimeout(() => heart.remove(), 4000);
    }, i * 180);
  }
}
</script>

</body>
</html>





